                  "description": "UTC time in Unix timestamp format. When this parameter is not specified, the latest available meteorological data will be returned.\nNote: Only forecast data for the following fixed UTC hours daily is queryable within the next 7 days: 02:00:00, 08:00:00, 14:00:00, 20:00:00."
                }
